{
 "title": "What If You Could Stop Time?",
 "duration": 271.88,
 "shots": [
  {
   "id": "s001",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.1,
   "line": "Dodgeball. Last one standing.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s002",
   "start": 2.1,
   "end": 7.02,
   "line": "Your friend winds up and throws, hard, straight at your face. You flinch.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s003",
   "start": 7.02,
   "end": 12.98,
   "line": "You squeeze your eyes shut and think one word. Stop. And everything does.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s004",
   "start": 12.98,
   "end": 16.9,
   "line": "The ball is hanging in the air, ten centimetres from your nose.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s005",
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 19.5,
   "line": "Your friend is frozen mid-laugh.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s006",
   "start": 19.5,
   "end": 22.28,
   "line": "A kid in the stands is frozen mid-sneeze.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s007",
   "start": 22.28,
   "end": 26.08,
   "line": "And it is completely, perfectly silent.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s008",
   "start": 26.08,
   "end": 27.82,
   "line": "So what if you could stop time?",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s009",
   "start": 27.82,
   "end": 30.44,
   "line": "Not slow it down. Stop it.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s010",
   "start": 30.44,
   "end": 33.04,
   "line": "For everyone except you.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s011",
   "start": 33.04,
   "end": 38.14,
   "line": "The first thing you notice is the quiet. No squeaking shoes. No shouting.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s012",
   "start": 38.14,
   "end": 39.74,
   "line": "Not even a hum.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s013",
   "start": 39.74,
   "end": 41.82,
   "line": "That's because sound is air moving.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s014",
   "start": 41.82,
   "end": 46.88,
   "line": "When someone shouts, they push air molecules, which push the next ones, all the way to your ear.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s015",
   "start": 46.88,
   "end": 53.0,
   "line": "Freeze the air, and there's nothing left to carry a sound. You clap your hands. Nothing.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s016",
   "start": 53.0,
   "end": 55.68,
   "line": "Then you try to walk, and it's like walking into a mattress.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s017",
   "start": 55.68,
   "end": 58.82,
   "line": "Air looks like nothing, but it's packed with molecules,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s018",
   "start": 58.82,
   "end": 63.46,
   "line": "normally zooming around at about five hundred metres a second. That's faster than a jet airliner.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s019",
   "start": 63.46,
   "end": 65.54,
   "line": "They usually bounce out of your way.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s020",
   "start": 65.54,
   "end": 67.72,
   "line": "Frozen, they don't move at all.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s021",
   "start": 67.72,
   "end": 72.36,
   "line": "Physicists who've thought about this say pushing through frozen air would take enormous force.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s022",
   "start": 72.36,
   "end": 73.84,
   "line": "You wouldn't be walking through air.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s023",
   "start": 73.84,
   "end": 78.52,
   "line": "You'd be shoving through a wall of it. And it gets worse.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s024",
   "start": 78.52,
   "end": 82.1,
   "line": "To see anything, light has to travel from the world into your eyes.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s025",
   "start": 82.1,
   "end": 84.18,
   "line": "A few tiny packets of light,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s026",
   "start": 84.18,
   "end": 87.22,
   "line": "called photons, have to land on the back of your eye.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s027",
   "start": 87.22,
   "end": 91.6,
   "line": "If time stops, light stops too. Nothing new reaches you.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s028",
   "start": 91.6,
   "end": 93.8,
   "line": "One philosopher of physics put it simply:",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s029",
   "start": 93.8,
   "end": 98.56,
   "line": "if you really stopped time, you probably couldn't see a thing.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s030",
   "start": 98.56,
   "end": 104.54,
   "line": "Silent, solid, and pitch black. Not a superpower. A prison.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s031",
   "start": 104.54,
   "end": 107.46,
   "line": "So, like every story that does this, let's cheat.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s032",
   "start": 107.46,
   "end": 110.42,
   "line": "Time stops everywhere, except in a little bubble around you.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s033",
   "start": 110.42,
   "end": 115.16,
   "line": "Inside your bubble, the air moves, so you can breathe, hear and walk.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s034",
   "start": 115.16,
   "end": 117.8,
   "line": "Light inside it still works, so you can see.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s035",
   "start": 117.8,
   "end": 120.4,
   "line": "Physicists will tell you there's no real science that allows this.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s036",
   "start": 120.4,
   "end": 123.14,
   "line": "But it's your power, so you get a bubble.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s037",
   "start": 123.14,
   "end": 127.98,
   "line": "You gently push the ball away from your face. You step out of the way. Then you let go.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s038",
   "start": 127.98,
   "end": 129.68,
   "line": "The ball sails past.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s039",
   "start": 129.68,
   "end": 134.64,
   "line": "Your friend's mouth drops open. How did you dodge that? Reflexes.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s040",
   "start": 134.64,
   "end": 137.18,
   "line": "You start testing it. And the bubble has rules.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s041",
   "start": 137.18,
   "end": 140.78,
   "line": "It only reaches about an arm's length around you.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s042",
   "start": 140.78,
   "end": 143.62,
   "line": "Outside it, everything is frozen, including the air.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s043",
   "start": 143.62,
   "end": 145.98,
   "line": "So there's no fresh air coming in.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s044",
   "start": 145.98,
   "end": 149.04,
   "line": "Just whatever is in your bubble and in your lungs.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s045",
   "start": 149.04,
   "end": 153.64,
   "line": "Most people can hold their breath for somewhere between thirty seconds and a minute and a half.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s046",
   "start": 153.64,
   "end": 156.46,
   "line": "Trained freedivers can go more than eleven minutes.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s047",
   "start": 156.46,
   "end": 161.22,
   "line": "But your brain can start to be damaged after about four minutes without oxygen.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s048",
   "start": 161.22,
   "end": 163.56,
   "line": "So your superpower comes with a timer.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s049",
   "start": 163.56,
   "end": 167.92,
   "line": "And you can't hear it ticking. And here's the thing.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s050",
   "start": 167.92,
   "end": 171.54,
   "line": "Scientists have actually stopped something. Light.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s051",
   "start": 171.54,
   "end": 176.16,
   "line": "In 2013, a team in Germany fired a beam of light into a special crystal,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s052",
   "start": 176.16,
   "end": 178.2,
   "line": "then switched off a second laser.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s053",
   "start": 178.2,
   "end": 182.58,
   "line": "The light stopped inside the crystal. For about a minute.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s054",
   "start": 182.58,
   "end": 185.56,
   "line": "Then they switched the laser back on, and the light came out again,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s055",
   "start": 185.56,
   "end": 189.48,
   "line": "carrying a tiny picture of three stripes. And in 2018,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s056",
   "start": 189.48,
   "end": 193.3,
   "line": "a camera at Caltech filmed at ten trillion frames a second.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s057",
   "start": 193.3,
   "end": 195.96,
   "line": "Fast enough to watch a pulse of light move.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s058",
   "start": 195.96,
   "end": 198.48,
   "line": "Your own brain even does a small version.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s059",
   "start": 198.48,
   "end": 200.28,
   "line": "Look quickly at a clock with a second hand,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s060",
   "start": 200.28,
   "end": 203.9,
   "line": "and the first second can seem to last longer than the others.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s061",
   "start": 203.9,
   "end": 207.1,
   "line": "It's called the stopped-clock illusion.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s062",
   "start": 207.1,
   "end": 209.56,
   "line": "Then one Saturday, it matters.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s063",
   "start": 209.56,
   "end": 213.74,
   "line": "Your friend's little brother chases a ball into the road. There's a van. It's too close.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s064",
   "start": 213.74,
   "end": 216.18,
   "line": "You stop time. Everything freezes.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s065",
   "start": 216.18,
   "end": 220.32,
   "line": "The van, the driver's face, the ball in mid-bounce. You run.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s066",
   "start": 220.32,
   "end": 223.26,
   "line": "But your bubble only reaches arm's length, and every step you take,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s067",
   "start": 223.26,
   "end": 227.08,
   "line": "you're pushing your bubble through frozen air. Ten seconds. Twenty.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s068",
   "start": 227.08,
   "end": 231.62,
   "line": "Your chest is burning. Forty. You reach him. You grab his jacket. You pull him back to the pavement.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s069",
   "start": 231.62,
   "end": 236.38,
